  storyText: "Watson Checkpoint\n\nNCPD barricades block the bridge out of Watson. Officers scan every vehicle. Your face is now flagged: WANTED FOR QUESTIONING.\n\nMirage: \"I can spoof your ID for about ten seconds.\"\n\n1. Floor it through the barricade.\n2. Let Mirage spoof your ID.\n3. Turn around."
